    {
      "title": "Game Modes",
      "anchor": "Game_Modes",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Jungle Practice",
          "anchor": "Jungle_Practice",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Added Practice to the list of Custom Lobby modes, available to launch with other players and bots"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Practice Menu",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Added Remove Items option (allows for repurchasing Starter Items, Relics)"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Added simple behavior controls for God Bots",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "text": "Idle"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Attack - Fight with basic attacks"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Patrol - Path in a 10m line"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Orbit - Path in a 10m circle"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "Ability - Uses the bot's A01"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Items can now be purchased globally from anywhere in the map",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "There's a small fountain near spawn for healing and testing fountain interactions (e.g. changing Achilles' equipment, Jing Wei leaving base)"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Added an interactable to cycle different NPCs at the center of the map",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Target Totem"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Jungle Camp + Buffs"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Gold Fury"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Free Practice (no NPC)"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Arena",
          "anchor": "Arena",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "“We previously made adjustments to Arena to speed it up overall, which it definitely did. We saw what generally took 19 minutes went down to ~12.5m. Looking back this change at best didn’t move the needle for the mode, and at worst might have turned people away given the ratio of time in queue to time in match. We like the quicker respawns overall, and believe bringing the ticket count up to 500 will bring this mode closer to 16 minutes which we think will be a nice spot for it.  We are also making some adjustments to the flower Pickup to provide bulk to tanks who pick it up. This lets them better serve as the frontline for their team, while making it easier to understand what you are gaining from picking it up.”"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Increased Domination Respawn Time Bonus: 10 -> 18s"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Increased Ticket Count: 425 -> 500"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Increased Surrender Time: 8m -> 10m"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased XP Bonus: 1.25x -> 1.1"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased Gold Spooling: 21 -> 15"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Decreased XP Spooling: 15 -> 10"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Gift Buff (Flower Pickup)",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Now grants 7.5% Strength, 7.5% Intelligence, and 5% Protections."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Reduced Strength / Intelligence Base: 15 -> 0"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Reduced Strength / Intelligence Bonus Per 3 Minutes: 10 -> 0"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Decreased Intensity of the Material Glow."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "Battle Cry (Arena Curio)",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Increased Stack Count: 5 -> 10"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Increased Stacks from God Kills: 1 -> 2"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Increased Stacks from God Assists: 0 -> 1"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Increased Stacks from Dying: 1 -> 2"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Decreased Stats from Items from Stacks: 3% -> 1.5%"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Decreased Movement Speed from Stacks: 3% -> 1.5%"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Decreased Buff Duration from 6s -> 3s"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Joust",
          "anchor": "Joust",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "“Joust is a relatively small map, and with the addition of the Bifrost Shard it was too easy to cover all the major chokepoints to have constant vision on your enemy. We think the Gjallarflare is going to be better for Joust, giving you targeted vision to see if players are doing a specific camp or boss; but only for a smaller window of time.”"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Replaced the default Curio with Gjallarflare."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Removed Bifrost Shard from Joust. Players can still change Gjallarflare into Heimdallr’s Sight."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Conquest",
          "anchor": "Conquest",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Oracle Ward no longer gives sentry vision"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
